\subsection{Implementation Details}
To train PRIG, we set the batch size to 3, learning rate to 1e-5, and optimizer to Adam \cite{kingma2014adam}. Both for the training and the inference stages, we set diffusion time steps to 1,000. PRIG requires a single NVIDIA A100 GPU for implementation.


