 \item There is a  double homoclinic cycle to \(E_1\)  along the approximated curve:
\begin{eqnarray*}
DH:\quad 0 =   \frac{7b^2 + 10bc^2 - 17c^2}{15c^3} \sqrt{\frac{-7b^2 + 5bc^2 + 2c^2}{5b}}, \quad b \in (0, c). 
\end{eqnarray*}
 \\
