E_2, E_3:\quad &\lambda_{\pm}^{2,3}=\frac {3{c}^{2}-{b}^{2}-2{c}^{2}b\pm\sqrt {4{c}^{4}{b}^{2}-
12{c}^{4}b-4{c}^{2}{b}^{3}+9{c}^{4}+2{c}^{2}{b}^{2}+{b}^{4}}}{2cb}.
\end{align*}

Based on linear analysis, the type of  equilibria for   \eqref{2d} (\(a=0\)) and for $b,c\in [-4,4]\times [-2,2]$ in different regions defined by \eqref{2d} are provided in Figures \ref{1fig} and \ref{CASEA}. \\

