meaning that there is a Pitchfork bifurcation  at $\mu=0$. If $c>1$, then the bifurcation is supercritical with respect to $\mu$ and also with respect to $b$ in the original equation, as depicted in Figure \ref{pitchfork1}. The analysis for the case $c>1$ is different from the case $0<c<1$, although the conclusion is the same. \\

