By calculating the first Lyapunov coefficient  (\cite[Equations (2) and (3)]{Verduzco}), we have:
\begin{align*}
l:= \dfrac{1}{16\omega} \left(R_1+ \omega R_2\right),
\end{align*}
where
\begin{align*}
