        \end{tabular}
        \end{center}}
        We took our original unlucky sequence from Section \ref{onecoin} and turned it into quite a good one.

        To analyze the game, let us first summarize the possible outcomes of a single flip in a table.
            {\tiny \begin{center}
        \begin{tabular}{ c | c c}
             Outcome & H & T\\\hline
            H & 2 & 6/5  \\
            T & 6/5 & 2/5
        \end{tabular}
        \end{center}}
