Thanks to these, a direct computation shows that
$$ \begin{array}{ll}
\medskip
\Sigma_4(a_{s,\,1}) &= \langle \{[a_{s,\,j}]:\, 1\leq j\leq 12\} \rangle,\\
\medskip
\Sigma_4(a_{s,\,13}) &= \langle \{[a_{s,\,j}]:\, 13\leq j\leq 24\} \rangle,\\
\medskip
\Sigma_4(a_{s,\,25}) &= \langle \{[a_{s,\,j}]:\, 25\leq j\leq 28\} \rangle.
