 (\sigma_4(h) + h) &\equiv_{\omega_{(s, 2)}}  \big((\beta_1 + \beta_2)a_{s,\, 25} + (\beta_2 + \beta_3)(a_{s,\, 36} + a_{s,\, 37})  + (\beta_3 + \beta_4)a_{s,\, 83}\big) \equiv 0,
\end{array}$$
and this is apparently that $\beta_1 = \beta_2 = \beta_3 = \beta_4.$ The proposition is proved.
\end{proof}

