\begin{lema}\label{bdc23}
The following hold:
\item[i)] $\Sigma_4(b_{s,\, 48})^{\Sigma_4} = \langle [\widehat{q_{s,\, 2}}]_{\omega_{(s, 1)}}\rangle$ with $\widehat{q_{s,\, 2}}:= \sum_{48\leq j\leq 53}b_{s,\, j}.$

