    \caption{Framework of the proposed SP-MDGNN. The dimensions shown illustrate the  adaptability to different tasks: In power control, dimensions relate to L (APs), K (UEs), M (antennas), and sparsity focuses on AP-UE links. In precoding, dimensions relate to K (UEs), N$_t$ (antennas), N$_s$ (RF chains), and sparsity focuses on user-antenna links.}
