&\\
\omega =& \ (\Bar{k}_{\mathrm{off}}^m) ^2+(\Bar{k}_{\mathrm{dp}}) ^2+(\Bar{k}_{\mathrm{off}}^A)^2-\Bar{k}_{\mathrm{off}}^m  \left(\Bar{k}_{\mathrm{dp}} +\Bar{k}_{\mathrm{off}}^A \right)-\Bar{k}_{\mathrm{dp}}  \Bar{k}_{\mathrm{off}}^A +3 \ \Bar{k}_{\mathrm{on}}^A  \Bar{k}_{\mathrm{on}}^{A'}\text{,} \\
