Heat map of ${\cal P}_{R|R_0} (t=t_1)$  in the same plane starting with non-uniform initial condition. We have used $t_1=10^8$ here. Both plots show an optimum region on $\epsilon - \alpha$ plane where RL algorithm is working best.} \label{fig:2sin_heatmap}
