Let $f_{\nu,1}(T)\in R\llbracket T\rrbracket$ be the power series from Proposition \ref{prop:kolyvaginderiv}. Consider $h(T) = f_{\nu,1}(T) - f_{\nu,1}(0)$. Then by the assumption $\nu(\varphi_D) \not\equiv 0 \pmod{\pi}$ and (\ref{eq:derivativecong}) we see that $h(T) \in TR\llbracket T\rrbracket^{\times}$. Thus for any $\zeta\in \mu_p^\ast$ we have
$$v_p(h(\zeta-1)) = v_p(\zeta-1) =\frac{1}{p-1}.$$
