Since the edge colors along the shorter and complementary paths, respectively, are also equal, by Corollary~\ref{Cor:J&WforCycle} we know that \(\sigma_{15}-\sigma_{610} \in I_{\cg_2}\), even though there is no graph symmetry in $\cg_2$. 
