\[
\operatorname{det}(K_{\setminus 1 \leftrightarrow 2}) 
=\operatorname{det}(K_{\setminus 3 \leftrightarrow 4}). 
\]
Therefore, the linear binomial $\sigma_{12} - \sigma_{34}$ lies in $I_{\cg_2}$. However, there is no symmetry in this $4$-cycle due to its specific coloring.

