\textsc{Keywords:} Inequality, Mobility, Immobility, Economic Mobility, Social Networks, Homophily, Social Capital, Job Referrals, Poverty Traps,
Job Contacts, Discrimination,  Social Norms, Networks, Complementarities, Affirmative Action, Peer Effects, Redistribution

\end{abstract}



