ized solutions exceed the intensities spanned within the 75-members ensemble. Figure \ref{fig:timeseries_main_var}b,d present the temperature and geopotential fields from the 75-iteration run. The temperature pattern features a maximum over the targeted region, albeit slightly to the south, while the 500 hPa geopotential height field exhibits an anticyclone directly overhead.

