   &=\prod_{\substack{p\\(p,r_1r_2)=1}}\left(1-\frac{\gcd(p^k,\delta_2)}{p^{k-1}(p+1)} \right)\left(1-\frac{\gcd(p^k,\delta_1)}{p^{k-1}(p+1)}\left(1-\frac{\gcd(p^k,\delta_2)}{p^{k-1}(p+1)} \right)^{-1} \right)\\&\times\prod_{\substack{p|r_2\\(p,r_1)=1}}\left(1-\frac{\gcd(p^k,\delta_1)}{p^{k}} \right)\prod_{\substack{p|r_1\\(p,r_2)=1}}\left(1-\frac{\gcd(p^k,\delta_2)}{p^k} \right)+\BigO{\frac{1}{R^{1-\frac{1}{k}}}}.
