The above estimate with \eqref{5} gives
\[\mathcal{N}(Q,k,m)\sum_{v=1}^{\mathcal{N}(Q,k,m)}(R_{\mathcal{N}(Q,k,m)}(\gamma_v))^2<CQ^{1+2\epsilon}, \]
where $C$ is a constant depending on $\epsilon$. By the Schwarz inequality, we have
